# Machine-managed permission grants - Claude Code writes narrow Bash(...)/
# PowerShell(...) rules here whenever you answer "yes, don't ask again".
# Tracking it means every mint dirties the tree and invites a cleanse that the
# next launch silently undoes. The rules are a symptom; fix the command shape
# instead (see reference_bash_permission_matching).
.claude/settings.local.json
